      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Magaambyans attendants have become full members of the Magaambya and begun to learn the secrets of the university. Not all Magaambyan attendants necessarily have this archetype, and this archetype doesn't represent the abilities of all attendants; rather, the archetype represents many of those who have affiliated with a branch and are pursuing conversant rank."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
