        "ordered": false,
        "items": [
          [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Uncommon"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Though the ultimate goal of the Pathfinder society is to learn, knowledge cannot be spread if those who discover it fail to come back alive. The Master of Swords teaches recruits to survive, to defend other Pathfinders, and to defeat the Society's enemies. The swordmaster embodies these skills, focusing on practicality and ignoring ideals or methods that interfere with their ability to overcome any challenge."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
